==> Parameters: 3(Long), MySQL常见错误(String), <p><strong>一、Row size too large. The maximum row size for the used table type, not counting BLOBs, is 65535</strong></p><p> 数据库字段长度设置超过最大长度</p><p><strong>二、quartz部署Table 'heart_beat.QRTZ_LOCKS' doesn't exist</strong></p><p>?QRTZ_LOCKS是大写，但是数据库中是小写qrtz_locks，其实就是linux 表名不区分大小写。</p><p>?解决办法：vi /etc/my.cnf 在 [mysqld] 节中添加： lower_case_table_names=1，然后重启MySQL: service mysqld restart。</p><p><strong>三、使用远程工具连接提示**Host *** is not allowed to connect to this mysql server**拒绝连接错误</strong></p><p>?解决办法：</p><p>?1、在安装Mysql数据库的主机上登录root用户：</p><p>? ?mysql -u root -p密码</p><p>?2、依次执行如下命令：</p><p>? ?use mysql;</p><p>? ?select host from user where user='root';</p><p>?3、将Host设置为通配符%</p><p>? ?update user set host = '%' where user ='root';</p><p>?4、给所有ip都赋予权限</p><p>? ?grant all privileges on *.* to 'root'@'%' identified by '123456';</p><p>?5、刷新</p><p>? ?flush privileges;</p><p><strong>四、数据库备份，用户名、密码正确，但是连接不上数据库</strong></p><p> localhost 换成 127.0.0.1</p><p><strong>五、Can't create database 'xxx' (errno: 28)</strong></p><p> 磁盘满了</p><p><strong>六、Caused by: java.sql.SQLSyntaxErrorException: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'character</strong></p><p><strong> </strong>'character 可能与关键字重复</p><p><strong>七、Host 'WIN-OHNE6K11KSM' is not allowed to connect to this MySQL server</strong></p><p><strong> </strong>mysql需要远程授权</p><p><strong>八、Incorrect string value: '\\xF0\\x9F\\x93\\x9E 1...' for column 'nickname' at row 1" 报错解决办法</strong></p><p>?遇到这种问题，是由于特殊字符占用4个字节，mysql默认的编码方式是utf8，只支持3个字节的。所以需要更改数据表的编码方式为utf8mb4。</p><p>?查看mysql的编码</p><p>?show variables like '%character%';</p><p>?结果如下：</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://zy.wlown.com/adminapi/uploads/image/20250819/eab4e365-42db-463d-bc76-19cee70b55c8.png" alt="" data-href="" style="width: 50%;"></p><p>修改表的字符集：</p><p>?语法：alter table 表名 convert to character set 字符集;把需要修改的数据表的编码方式改成utf8mb4即可。</p><p><strong>九、mysql的时区错误问题： The server time zone value '???ú±ê×??±??' is unrecognized or represents more than one</strong></p><p>?问题：The server time zone value '???ú±ê×??±??' is unrecognized or represents more than one time zone....</p><p>?解决方案:</p><p>?show variables like '%time_zone%';</p><p>?set global time_zone='+8:00';</p>(String), richtext(String), 1784976670374(Long), 48(Long)
